# `mix` reads 120 fields off `a`, which are then held, stores each through `b` and reads it off `a` again. In the first call the two are one object.
# From about the thirty-fifth store on the walk goes through what it holds by lists. Two things end the slot under the name written there: the look for aliased slots of the typed store, and what the
# store's effects end, which spares the slots under other names. Either alone gives the right sum; with both switched off the first sum is 48280.
# -- source: main.js
